      "message": "I think we should keep the flag. It is used to generate soft resets when a protocol error happens during an AMS. See Section 6.8.1 of spec.\n\nThere are fewer interruptilbe messages so I it more efficient to check for them than doing it the other way. But I\u0027m open to changing it to non-interruptible.",
